  "language_probability": 1.0,
  "text": "Your agent can crash. Your neuroscience research shouldn't have to start over. We built Second Shift, a neuroscience harness. Claude proposes experiments to classify imagined hand and foot movements from EEG. Our pipeline measures the results. MongoDB Atlas preserves the evidence. Now, let's pull the plug. The worker disappears, but its completed results stay. Restart it and the harness rebuilds context. Completed results are reused. The interrupted experiment runs again. Now we erase the context and cut the electrode limit from sixty-four to nine. The harness rechecks the evidence, then continues the search with fewer sensors. With Second Shift, your agent starts fresh and your neuroscience research moves forward.",
